      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sense of being out of sync, like you're from a different time, is a very lonely place to be. If the era is gone, then maybe the pressure to fit into its ruins is what's draining you. Instead of trying to catch up to a world that has already moved on, consider what it would feel like to simply step out of the narrative entirely. There's a quiet peace in just letting go of the need to belong to anything.",
